codex
The repository-wide check hit unrelated failures outside Phase 1: the suite expects an `e3d-trade` sibling checkout and a few existing CLI/config tests are already failing in this workspace. I’m collecting the final tail of that run, then I’ll write the required handoff with Phase 1 status and those verification limits called out clearly.
diff --git a/lib/authority/policy.js b/lib/authority/policy.js
